openmodelica.bib is the bibliography of OpenModelica. The User's Guide
cites it, and the Research menu of www.openmodelica.org shows it: its
build downloads the file from the master branch and generates one page
per BibTeX type (article, inproceedings, phdthesis, mastersthesis).

When the file changes on master, the Jenkins stage
update-website-bibliography starts the build of the website.

extrarefs.bib has further references of the User's Guide.
